# Optional universal password gate (same pattern as Little LaiBrary).
# When APP_PASSWORD is set, the whole app — pages, API, and realtime
# sockets — requires a one-time sign-in per device. The signed cookie
# lasts 400 days and renews itself whenever the app is opened, so in
# practice each family device signs in once. Leave unset for open
# local development. Henry sets this in Railway himself; never commit
# a real password.
APP_PASSWORD=

# Optional: comma-separated dev origin for CORS (defaults to the Vite dev server)
# WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Optional persistent VAPID keys (otherwise generated once and stored in the data file)
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:support@yourdomain.com

# Optional data directory for the JSON store (Railway: mount a volume here, e.g. /app/data)
# DATA_DIR=/app/data
